<title>USA: Manassas, Va., $6.300 mln won by Ferris Baker.</title>
<headline>Manassas, Va., $6.300 mln won by Ferris Baker.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferris Baker Watts said it won $6.300 million of Manassas, Va., general obligation bonds, Series 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 5.37 percent.</p>
